# Day 2 — Expense & Income Analysis

### What I learned
- How to convert date and time values into proper date format  
- How to apply currency conversion considering commission fees  
- How to categorize transactions using lookup functions  
- How to build pivot tables to analyze daily expenses and income

---

### What I did (Step by step)
- Converted the operation date and time into date format using `DATEVALUE()` and applied Date formatting  
- Converted card currency amounts into UAH (Ukrainian Hryvnia) taking into account commission via `IF()` function  
- Added categories to each transaction (expense or income) using `VLOOKUP()`  
- Built a pivot table showing income and expenses for each day and applied conditional formatting (green = income, red = expense)  
- Built another pivot table showing expenses by category, with an additional grouping level by transaction details

---

### ✅ Tools & skills used
- `DATEVALUE()` function  
- `IF()` function  
- `VLOOKUP()` function  
- Pivot tables  
- Conditional formatting (green/red)  
- Currency conversion logic

